{520}{A bit of a recluse, he is. No one gets in to see him, from what I have heard. If you want a good laugh, though, look up old Cedric Appleby, his chief competitor. He lives at 1 Low Dervish way, on the corner of Dervish and Lion's Head Circle, I believe.}{A bit of a recluse, he is. No one gets in to see him, from what I have heard. If you want a good laugh, though, look up old Cedric Appleby, his chief competitor. He lives at 1 Low Dervish way, on the corner of Dervish and Lion's Head Circle, I believe.}{}{}{}{ru2198}
{521}{Why is that a laugh?}{}{5}{}{530}{}
{522}{Why? He funny silly guy?}{}{-4}{}{530}{}
{530}{He hates old Gilbert, he does. Sends him into a complete frenzy if you mention Bates' name to him. He's always trying to discredit Bates somehow or other.}{He hates old Gilbert, he does. Sends him into a complete frenzy if you mention Bates' name to him. He's always trying to discredit Bates somehow or other.}{}{}{}{}
{531}{Why?}{}{1}{}{540}{}
{537}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{540}{Jealousy. Bates is a genius, and Appleby couldn't make a decent steam engine to save his life.}{Jealousy. Bates is a genius, and Appleby couldn't make a decent steam engine to save his life.}{}{}{}{}
